{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":34,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"12b04844-15f4-49a7-b4d4-67cd9a57842b","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151122806,"PostDateInt":1767695638000,"PostDate":"2026-01-06T18:33:58","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"机械臂算法专家","OrgId":1764300,"Org":"研发中心","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市","安徽省·芜湖市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.多轴机械臂运动控制算法的开发，刚柔耦合动力学建模，辨识及其抗扰控制和振动抑制；\n2.能够基于刚柔耦合理论与数据驱动辨识算法，设计优化激励轨迹，提升辨识的模型精度；\n3.能够开展机械臂的有限元建模并开展复模态、动力学分析;\n4.能够使用C++代码/Matlab进行建模、仿真、算法验证与优化，并输出对应的文档。","Require":"1.統招硕士及以上学历，自动化、机械电子、控制工程等相关专业毕业；\n2.具有扎实的数学基础、控制理论和机器人学理论；\n3.熟练阅读英文文献，撰写英文文档，能够用英文口语进行技术沟通；\n4.喜欢钻研，敢于面对复杂问题，有一定的抗压能力，能够持续自我学习；\n5.善于沟通，有良好的団队协作精神。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"硕士研究生","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-01-06T18:33:58","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"2315a953-9ae9-4b67-9d36-9c3681f76327","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151276036,"PostDateInt":1794965064000,"PostDate":"2026-11-18T09:24:24","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"墨斗IDE-几何算法工程师","OrgId":1764303,"Org":"启智智能机器人","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 负责点云几何算法方向项目的需求统筹、任务拆分、进度跟踪与风险识别，保障项目按计划高质量落地交付；统筹 C++ 开发团队日常管理、技术培养、绩效评估，搭建团队技术氛围，持续提升团队整体能力。\n2. 网格处理与曲面重构：开发高鲁棒性的点云转网格生成算法（如 Marching Cubes、Delaunay 变体等），实现从残缺点云 / 体素中精准重建连续曲面，并精确提取曲率梯度与法向场。\n3. 局部配准与形变控制（ARAP）：开发基于稀疏特征块的配准算子，结合图割（Graph Cuts）与自由变形（FFD）等底层算法，实现网格拓扑的平滑形变扩散与高精度对齐。\n4. 主导 C++ 软件架构设计与核心模块开发，攻克程序崩溃、内存泄漏、多线程并发、底层系统疑难问题，熟练使用调试工具定位问题；统筹团队代码规范、开发流程、交付质量标准，持续迭代流程，提升交付效率与稳定性。\n5. 对接算法、硬件等内部团队，协调设备端与平台端的数据交互、几何算法集成，保障软硬件、算法模块协同稳定；输出需求分析、系统设计等技术文档，闭环跟进项目风险与问题。","Require":"1. 本科及以上，计算机、数学、自动化、软件工程等理工科专业；4-5 年 C++ 研发经验（优秀硕士可 3 年、本科可放宽至 5 年），至少 1 年模块负责人 / 小组负责人管理经验。\n2. 精通 C++，熟练掌握 C++11 及以上新特性；具备白板推导、手写三维几何、点云相关底层算法的能力；熟悉网络编程、多线程编程，扎实的调试能力，可独立解决崩溃、内存问题、Windows 底层问题，熟练使用 WinDbg/Visual Studio。\n3. 扎实的线性代数、微积分、计算几何理论功底；熟悉八叉树、KD 树、图结构等底层空间数据结构，熟悉并行计算；具备需求拆解、项目进度管控、风险识别实战经验，可快速响应并闭环问题。\n4. 优秀跨部门沟通协作能力，可和硬件、算法、平台团队高效协同；熟练使用 AI 辅助开发工具优先；有工业自动化、嵌入式 / 设备端软件开发经验优先","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-18T09:24:24","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"779bf8c7-c2a5-4563-b4cb-eb0329549750","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151265322,"PostDateInt":1792479953000,"PostDate":"2026-10-20T15:05:53","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"机器人产品经理（半导体行业）","OrgId":1764303,"Org":"启智智能机器人","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市","安徽省·芜湖市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"负责面向半导体晶圆厂与封装测试厂的洁净室内用机器人的产品定义与全生命周期管理。岗位需贯通组织协调：需求挖掘、产品定义、设计需求细化、设计导入、样机验证、产品导入全过程，对产品的性能、洁净、安全、成本与商业化负责。\n1、场景需求挖掘与市场分析；\n2、产品定义与规格设计；\n3、跨团队方案对齐与样机验证；\n4、客户试点、量产导入与产品线经营。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，机械、自动化、机器人、电子信息等工科专业；\n2、3年及以上，半导体芯片Fab厂新设备导入经验，或半导体设备厂对Fab厂的售前技术对接经验，熟悉立项、样机、试产到量产完整流程；\n3、了解半导体设备组成，能理解算法与调度系统（WMS/MCS/EAP）对接，对生产管理系统动作指令的落地链路有基本认知；\n4、能独立输出 PRD、规格书与需求验收标准，跨电控、结构、视觉、固件、算法团队推进项目；\n5、优秀的需求拆解、风险识别、跨部门推动能力；可接受产线现场调研与短期出差。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-20T15:05:53","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"760d5abf-fca6-46f2-9a53-9f460f14d206","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151262616,"PostDateInt":1791874360000,"PostDate":"2026-10-13T14:52:40","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"人形机器人-主管电气工程师","OrgId":1764303,"Org":"启智智能机器人","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["安徽省·芜湖市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、负责机器人电气系统的方案设计、器件选型(如同服驱动器、电机、传感器、控制器、电 源等)与评估。\n2、使用EDA工具进行原理图设计和PCBLayout，并负表电路板的调试与测试。\n3、负责机器人线束的设计、制造跟进与测试，确保电气连接的可靠性与EMC性能。\n4、与嵌入式工程师、软件工程师、机械工程师协作，定义接口，并协助进行软硬件联调。\n5、参与机器人系统的集成、调试和测试工作，解决电气相关的硬件问题，编写和维护电气相关的设计文档、测试报告和物料清单。","Require":"1、本科及以上学历，电气工程、自动化，电子信息工程等相关专业。\n2、3年以上硬件/电气开发经验，有机器人或自动化设备行业经验者优先。\n3、熟练掌握至少一种EDA软件，具备独立完成多层PCB设计与调试的能力。\n4、熟悉伺服电机、步进电机及其驱动控制原理。\n5、熟悉常用的通信接口(CAN,EtherCAT,SPI, I2C,UART)。\n6、能够熟练使用示波器、万用表、逻辑分析仪等仪器进行硬件调试。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-13T14:52:40","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"6983acc8-2afd-4428-8299-514b71250c83","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151260494,"PostDateInt":1791442003000,"PostDate":"2026-10-08T14:46:43","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"激光切割应用工程师","OrgId":1764287,"Org":"平台产品线","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["安徽省·芜湖市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1、机器人精度提升项目：配合研发进行厂内不同机型、不同工况下的切割精度提升验证、实切效果优化测试；\n2、机器人激光切割系统调试：利用厂内激光切割测试工作站，验证与积累不同应用工况下的碳钢、不锈钢、铝材等不同材质，不同气体、不同速度下的工艺参数调整，解决切割挂渣、切面粗糙、尺寸偏差、尖角烧边、变形等工艺问题，积累经验，形成切割工艺库。\n3、针对三维激光切割工况，利用离线编程软件进行仿真，能自动生成切割程序，在实机进行精度和工艺效果验证；\n4、协助产品经理，洞察市场需求，协同开发团队，提出激光切割工艺包的开发需求，持续迭代与优化，提升用户工艺调参易用性；\n5、视觉系统集成与调试：独立完成机器人激光切割配套2D/3D视觉定位、视觉寻边、焊缝/切割轨迹识别、工件纠偏、来料检测系统的参数标定、相机校准、光源调试、模板匹配、视觉算法参数优化，实现视觉引导机器人自动切割、自动补位、偏差修正，解决视觉识别偏移、误识别、适配性差等现场问题。\n6、技术优化与培训：持续优化激光切割工艺与视觉识别方案，迭代最优工艺参数；对售前售后及客户操作人员、现场运维人员开展切割工艺与常规调试、常见故障处理等培训。\n7、售后技术支持：负责项目交付后的售后技术跟进，快速响应现场问题，提供技术解决方案，保障客户生产正常运转。","Require":"1、学历专业：大专及以上学历，具备机械制造、自动化、工业机器人、激光切割应用等相关专业。\n2、工作经验：3年及以上工业机器人激光切割现场调试经验，具备成熟的机器视觉应用调试实战经验，有主导三维激光切割、机器人视觉引导切割项目落地经验者优先。\n3、核心技能：熟练掌握国内外发那科、ABB、STEP、卡诺普等主流工业机器人的示教编程、路径优化、离线编程与仿真等技术；精通激光切割工艺，熟悉光纤激光发生器参数调节，掌握不同气体、不同材质、不同工件厚度的切割工艺标准，可独立调试并解决各类切割工艺缺陷；熟练掌握2D/3D视觉系统调试，熟悉主流视觉品牌，独立完成相机标定、视觉定位、轨迹跟随、工件纠偏等视觉功能调试，懂视觉图像参数优化；具备机械三维制图能力，有能独立看懂机械、电气图纸，具备现场问题快速排查与解决能力。\n4、综合能力：能适应项目短频出差，抗压能力强，具备良好的沟通协调能力、文档输出能力与团队协作意识，做事严谨负责。\n5、优先条件：有汽车零部件、五金管材、钣金件等机器人激光切割项目经验；精通视觉应用与调试经验者优先。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"大专","YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-10-08T14:46:43","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"d3cff7fb-1c71-455e-a0e4-0a19b5458274","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":151258407,"PostDateInt":1790229766000,"PostDate":"2026-09-24T14:02:46","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"Openmind OS-VLA算法工程师","OrgId":1764303,"Org":"启智智能机器人","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["上海市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.负责VLA（视觉-语言-动作）相关模型及多模态算法的研发与迭代，实现大模型在机器人上的应用。\n2.负责算法框架的研发，并开展VLA模型的训练、微调与部署工作。\n3.处理多模态数据，构建高质量训练的数据集，优化模型泛化能力与鲁棒性。\n4.推动VLA模型在机器人场景落地，解决模型部署过程中的相关技术难题，确保机器人能在真实场景中完成长流程、高动态的操作任务。\n5.跟踪VLA领域前沿技术，开展模型相关预研与创新，并在自有机器人平台上进行复现、改进和部署。\n6.探索强化学习（RL）在复杂场景及复杂任务中的实际应用。","Require":"1.硕士及以上学历，计算机、人工智能等相关专业，有VLA或相关模型研发经验者优先。\n2.精通Python，熟悉深度学习框架，具备多模态模型或VLA相关模型开发经验。\n3.熟悉强化学习理论基础，并有实际落地经验。\n4.掌握视觉、语言相关算法，了解模型训练、微调与部署流程，有相关实操经验。\n5.具备良好的逻辑思维、问题解决能力，能独立完成核心模型模块研发。","ClassificationOne":"研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-09-24T14:02:46","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null}],"Total":0}